<title>UK: Nederlandse Gasunie sets 200 mln mark 5-year bond.</title>
<headline>Nederlandse Gasunie sets 200 mln mark 5-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NEDERLANDSE GASUNIE</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   COUPON     2.50	MATURITY    12.NOV.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  92.29     PAY DATE    12.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	REOFFER    90.04     SPREAD	+10 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFT/LUX   PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA     DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NL/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  NETHER    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.75	LIST FEE    0.50</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5.0 PERCENT 119 OBL</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
